The kprobe pre_handler receives struct pt_regs for the probed function.
For __x64_sys_mkdir, the first argument is itself a pt_regs pointer.
Use regs_get_kernel_argument(regs, 0) to extract it, then read uregs->di
for the userspace pathname. Copy it with strncpy_from_user, find the
basename with strrchr, and check for the "rklings." prefix.
